    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you, but isn't it a bit much to call it \"colonial violence\" when the whole point of the era was building a new nation? most people visiting a museum about American history want to feel that sense of national pride and achievement. if we focus too much on the conflict, don't we lose the actual story of how the country became what it is today?",
