    "summary": "The user asks the AI to write an epic, progress-oriented museum introduction about Westward Expansion. When the user explicitly asks if this \"march of progress\" framing is one-sided, the assistant suggests balancing it with the perspective of Indigenous displacement and \"colonial violence.\" The user pushes back, arguing for a focus on national pride, and the assistant suggests a compromise of weaving both threads together.",
